# Normalize line endings: store text as LF in the repo and check it out as LF
# on every platform. This project builds and runs in a Linux container, so LF
# everywhere is what the code actually wants — and it silences Git's CRLF
# conversion warnings on Windows checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files Git must never touch (auto-detection is usually right, but being
# explicit avoids any chance of a mangled image or font).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db   binary
